1c:["$","div","2",{"className":"p-4 rounded-xl border-l-4 text-gray-800 leading-relaxed bg-blue-50 border-blue-400","children":[false,"Position the patient as late as possible, particularly for lithotomy and Sims. These positions are uncomfortable and expose the patient, and leaving someone in one while waiting for the provider is a genuine and avoidable indignity. Drape so that only the area being examined is uncovered, and adjust the drape rather than the patient when possible."]}]
